    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Fill command (code 9). Shows the label FILL. While the pen is on the pad, keeps the cursor position in shape_x0/shape_y0 and moves the cursor sprites there. On a button press with the pen on the pad, fills from the kept point ($3709). A long press off the pad goes to tool_exit."},
